# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately excluded from this PUBLIC repository.
# Paths are anchored with a leading slash so src/content/ (the blog) is NOT
# affected — only the research folders at the repo root.
#
# /content/ is the capture of the previous Framer site: ~44MB of imagery and
# video (much of it stock, licensed for that site rather than for
# redistribution) plus a defect list written for internal use. The client
# logos the new site actually needs live in public/brand/ and are committed.
#
# /docs/ holds the internal SEO audit and build plan. They candidly document
# gaps in the business — no Companies House registration, unsourced
# statistics, a broken booking link — and are not written for publication.
#
# Delete either line if you want them public.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/content/
/docs/
